    "text": "in die sancto pentecosten Fram \u00feam halgan easterlican d\u00e6ge sind getealde fiftig daga to \u00feysum\n\u00dees d\u00e6ig w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6 geset and gehalgod;\nGod bebead moyse on egypta lande. \u00fe\u00e6t he and eall israhela folc sceoldon offrian \u00e6t \u00e6lcum\nAnd israhela folc ferde on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan nihte of \u00feam leodscipe: and god hi l\u00e6dde ofer \u00fea readan s\u00e6\n\u00d0a tengde se phareo \u00e6fter mid micelre fyrde. \u00fea \u00f0a he com onmiddan \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6 \u00fea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t godes\n\u00d0a bebead god moyse and \u00feam folce \u00fe\u00e6t hi heoldon \u00f0a tid mid micelre arwur\u00f0nysse on \u00e6lces geares\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s seo tid \u00feam folce geset to eastertide. for \u00fean \u00f0e god hi hredde wi\u00f0 heora feondum. and\n\u00d0a \u00fe\u00e6s ymbe fiftig daga sette god \u00feam folce \u00e6. and w\u00e6s gesewen godes wuldor uppon anre dune \u00fee\n\u00d0\u00e6t geoffrode lamb getacnode cristes slege. se \u00fee unsc\u00e6\u00f0\u00f0i w\u00e6s his f\u00e6der geoffrod for ure\nNu is his \u00ferowung and his \u00e6rist ure eastertid: for \u00fean \u00f0e he us alysde fram deofles \u00feeowdome. and\n\u00d0as fiftig daga fram \u00feam easterlican d\u00e6ge sind ealle gehalgode to anre m\u00e6rsunge. and \u00fees\nOn \u00feam ealdan pentecosten sette god \u00e6. \u00feam israhela folce: and on \u00feysum d\u00e6ge com se halga gast\nFor \u00fei eallswa \u00fe\u00e6t lamb getacnode cristes \u00ferowunge: swa eac seo ealde \u00e6 getacnode\n\u00d0reo tida sind on \u00feissere worulde: an is seo \u00fee w\u00e6s buton \u00e6. o\u00f0er is seo \u00f0e w\u00e6s under \u00e6. seo\nWe ne sind na buton \u00e6 ne we ne moton healdan moyses \u00e6 lichamlice ac godes gifu us gewissa\u00f0 to\nHit is gereht on \u00f0isere pistolr\u00e6dinge: hu se halga gast on \u00feysum d\u00e6ge com to \u00f0am geleaffullan\nLucas se godspellere awrat on \u00fe\u00e6re bec. actus apostolorum. \u00fe\u00e6t se halga hired w\u00e6s wuniende\n\u00d0a on \u00feysum d\u00e6ge \u00fee is pentecostes gecweden com f\u00e6rlice micel swegi of heofonum and gefylde\nAnd w\u00e6s \u00e6teowod bufon heora \u00e6lcum swilce fyrene tungan: and hi wurdon \u00fea ealle gefyllede mid\n\u00d0a w\u00e6ron gegadrode binnon \u00fe\u00e6re byrig hierusalem eawf\u00e6ste weras of \u00e6lcere \u00f0eode \u00fee under\n\u00d0a wear\u00f0 seo meniu swi\u00fee ablicged and mid wundrunge cw\u00e6don;\nLa hu ne sind \u00feas \u00fee her spreca\u00f0 galileisce: and ure \u00e6lc gehyrde hu hi spr\u00e6con urum gereordum on\n\u00d0a andwyrde petrus;\nHit is underntid: hu mihte we on \u00feyssere tide beon fordrencte? Ac \u00fe\u00e6s witegan cwyde ioheles is nu\nGod cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6s witegan mu\u00f0. \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde his gast asendan ofer menniscum fl\u00e6sce: and\nWite ge so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t crist aras of dea\u00f0e. and on ure gewitnysse astah to heofonum. and sit \u00e6t his\nDrihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to minum drihtne site to minre swi\u00f0ran o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t ic alecge \u00feine fynd under \u00feinum\n\u00dea \u00f0\u00e6t folc \u00feis gehyrde \u00fea wurdon hi onbryrde and cw\u00e6don to \u00f0am apostolon: la leof hw\u00e6t is us to\nBehreowsia\u00f0 eowre synna. and underfo\u00f0 fulluht on cristes naman. and eowre synna beo\u00f0\n\u00dea underfengon his lare. and bugon to fulluhte on \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fereo \u00f0usend manna: \u00fea w\u00e6ron ealle on\nEft on o\u00f0re bodunge gelyfdon fif \u00feusend wera on crist: and wear\u00f0 eall seo geleaffulle meniu swa\n\u00d0a \u00f0e landare h\u00e6fdon hi hit beceapodon. and \u00fe\u00e6t wur\u00f0 brohton to \u00fe\u00e6ra apostola foton: hi \u00fea\n\u00d0a worhte god fela tacna on \u00feam folce \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6ra apostola handum: swa \u00fe\u00e6t hi gelogedon \u00fea\n\u00d0a arn micel meniu. to: of gehendum burgum. and brohton heora untruman. and \u00fea deofolseocan\nHi setton heora handa ofer gelyfedum mannum and hi underfengon \u00feone halgan gast;\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s sum \u00feegen annanias gehaten. and his wif saphira hi cw\u00e6don him betweonan \u00fe\u00e6t hi woldon\nCom \u00fea se \u00feegen mid feo to \u00feam apostolum;\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 petrus: annania: deofol bep\u00e6hte \u00feine heortan. and \u00feu h\u00e6fst alogen \u00feam halgan gast;\nHwi woldest \u00feu swician on \u00feinum agenum ne luge \u00feu na mannum ac gode;\n\u00d0a he \u00feas word gehyrde. \u00fea feol he adune and gewat;\n\u00d0a \u00fea he bebyrged w\u00e6s \u00fea com his wif saphira: and nyste hu hyre were gelumpen w\u00e6s;\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 petrus;\nSege me. beceapode ge \u00feus micel landes: heo andwyrde. gea leof swa micel;\nEft \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 petrus;\nHwi gewear\u00f0 inc swa: \u00fe\u00e6t git dorston fandian godes? heo feoll \u00fe\u00e6rrihte and gewat. and hi man\n\u00d0a wear\u00f0 micel ege on godes gela\u00f0unge and on eallum \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t geaxodon;\n\u00d0a apostoli sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6r \u00fean \u00f0e hi toferdon gesetton iacobum \u00fee w\u00e6s gehaten rihtwis on cristes setle.\nHe \u00f0a ges\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t setl \u00feritig geara: and \u00e6fter him symeon \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes m\u00e6ig;\n\u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6re gebysnunge wurdon ar\u00e6rede munuclif mid \u00fe\u00e6re gehealdsumnysse \u00fe\u00e6t hi drohtnion on\nGe gehyrdon lytle \u00e6r on \u00feisre r\u00e6dinge: \u00fe\u00e6t se halga gast com ofer \u00feam apostolon on fyrenum\nHit getimode \u00e6fter noes flode \u00fe\u00e6t entas woldon ar\u00e6ran ane burh and \u00e6nne stypel swa heahne \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dea w\u00e6s an gereord on eallum mancynne. and \u00fe\u00e6t weorc w\u00e6s begunnen ongean godes willan;\nGod eac for \u00fei hi tostencte: swa \u00fe\u00e6t he forgeaf \u00e6lcum \u00fe\u00e6ra wyrhtena seltcu\u00f0 gereord: and heora\nHi \u00f0a geswicon \u00fe\u00e6re getimbrunge: and toferdon geond ealne middaneard and w\u00e6ron sy\u00f0\u00f0an swa\nNu eft on \u00feysum d\u00e6ge \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6s halgan gastes tocyme wurdon ealle gereord geanl\u00e6hte and\nOn \u00feysre geferr\u00e6dene geearnode heora eadmodnys \u00feas mihte. and \u00fe\u00e6ra enta modignyss geearnode\nSe halga gast w\u00e6s \u00e6teowod ofer \u00feam apostolon on fyres hiwe. and ofer criste on his fulluhte on\nHwi ofer criste on culfran hiwe? Hwi ofer cristes hirede on fyres gelicnysse? On bocum is geredd be\nSe h\u00e6lend is ealles mancynnes dema: ac he ne com na to demenne mancynn swa swa he sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0.\nGif he \u00fea wolde deman mancynn \u00fea \u00f0a he \u00e6rest to middanearde com: Hwa wurde \u00feonne gehealden?\n\u00c6rest he wolde us mid ly\u00f0nysse styran \u00fe\u00e6t he sy\u00f0\u00f0an mihte on his dome us gehealdan;\nFor \u00fei w\u00e6s se halga gast on culfran anlicnysse gesewen bufon criste. for \u00fean \u00f0e he w\u00e6s\nHe ne hrymde. ne biterwyrde n\u00e6s: ne he sace ne astyrede: ac forb\u00e6r manna yfelnyssa \u00feurh his\nAc se \u00fee on \u00feam \u00e6rran tocyme li\u00feegode \u00feam synfullum to gecyrrednysse: se dem\u00f0 sti\u00f0ne dom \u00feam\nSe halga gast w\u00e6s gesewen on fyrenum tungum bufon \u00feam apostolon for \u00fean \u00f0e he dyde \u00fe\u00e6t hi\nFyrene tungan hi h\u00e6fdon \u00fea \u00f0a hi mid lufe godes m\u00e6r\u00fea bodedon. \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00f0enra manna\nGif se halga gast ne l\u00e6r\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s mannes mood wi\u00f0innan: on idel beo\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s bydeles word wi\u00f0utan\nFyres gecynd is \u00fe\u00e6t hit fornym\u00f0 swa hw\u00e6t swa him gehende bi\u00f0;\nSwa sceal se lareow don se \u00fee bi\u00f0 mid \u00fean halgan gaste onbryrd. \u00e6rest on him sylfum \u00e6lcne\nOn culfran anlicnysse. and on fyres hiwe w\u00e6s godes gast \u00e6teowod. for \u00fean \u00f0e he de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a beo\u00f0\nNe bi\u00f0 seo bylewitnys gode gecweme buton snoternysse: ne seo snoternys buton bylewitnysse: swa\nHw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 rihtwisnyss buton bilewitnysse? o\u00f0\u00f0e hw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 bylewitnys buton rihtwisnysse? ac se\nGod is swa swa paulus cw\u00e6\u00f0 fornimende fyr: he is unasecgendlic fyr and ungesewenlic;\nBe \u00feam fyre cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend;\nIc com to \u00f0y \u00fe\u00e6t ic wolde sendan fyr on eor\u00fean. and ic wylle \u00fe\u00e6t hit byrne;\nHe sende \u00feone halgan gast to eor\u00fean. and he mid his bl\u00e6de on\u00e6lde eor\u00f0licra manna heortan;\n\u00d0onne byrn\u00f0 seo eor\u00f0e: \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s eor\u00f0lican mannes heorte bi\u00f0 ontend to godes lufe: seo \u00f0e \u00e6r\nNis na se halga gast wuniende on his gecynde swa swa he gesewen w\u00e6s: for \u00fean \u00f0e he is\nAc for \u00fe\u00e6re getacnunge swa we \u00e6r cw\u00e6don he w\u00e6s \u00e6teowod on culfran and on fyre;\nHe is gehaten on greciscum gereorde paraclitus \u00fe\u00e6t is froforgast. for \u00fei \u00f0e he frefra\u00f0 \u00fea dreorigan\nHe forgif\u00f0 synna and he is se wegi to forgyfenysse ealra synna;\nHe syl\u00f0 his gife \u00feam \u00fee he wile: sumum menn he forgif\u00f0 wisdom. and spr\u00e6ce. sumum good\nEalle \u00feas \u00f0ing de\u00f0 se halga gast tod\u00e6lende \u00e6ighwylcum be \u00f0am \u00fee him gewyr\u00f0. for \u00fean \u00f0e he is\nHe onlihte dauides heortan \u00fea \u00f0a he on geogo\u00f0e hearpan lufode. and worhte hine to sealmwyrhtan;\nAmos hatte sum hry\u00feerhyrde. \u00feone awende se halga gast to m\u00e6rum witegan;\nPetrus w\u00e6s fiscere. \u00feone awende se ylca godes gast to apostole;\nPaulus ehte cristenra manna \u00feone he geceas to lareowe eallum \u00feeodum;\nMatheus w\u00e6s tollere \u00feone he awende to godspellere;\n\u00d0a apostoli ne dorston bodian \u00f0one so\u00f0an geleafan for ogan iudeisces folces. ac sy\u00f0\u00f0an hi w\u00e6ron\n\u00d0ises d\u00e6ges wur\u00femynt is to m\u00e6rsigenne: for \u00fean \u00f0e se \u00e6lmihtiga god \u00fe\u00e6t is se halga gast\nOn cristes acennednysse wear\u00fe se \u00e6lmihtiga godes sunu to menniscum men gedoon: and on \u00feysum\n\u00d0a gecorenan sind godes bearn. and eac godas. na gecyndelice ac \u00feurh gife \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes;\nAn god is gecyndelice on \u00ferim hadum: f\u00e6der and his sunu. \u00fe\u00e6t is his wisdom. and se halga gast se\nCrist underfeng menniscnysse on his tocyme and menn underfengon god \u00feurh neosunge \u00fe\u00e6s\nSe man \u00fee n\u00e6f\u00f0 godes gast on him. nis he godes;\n\u00c6lces mannes weorc cy\u00f0a\u00f0 hwilc gast hine wissa\u00f0;\nGodes gast wissa\u00f0 symle to halignysse and godnysse: deofles gast wissa\u00f0 to leahtrum. and to\nSe halga gast becom tua ofer \u00feam apostolum;\nCrist ableow \u00feone halgan gast uppon \u00feam apostolon \u00e6r his upstige. \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende. onfo\u00f0 haligne\nEft on \u00feysum d\u00e6ge asende se \u00e6lmihtiga f\u00e6der. and se sunu heora beigra gast. to \u00feam geleaffullan\nOn \u00feisre worulde wuniende. Se h\u00e6lend ableow his gast on his gingrum for \u00fe\u00e6re getacnunge \u00fe\u00e6t hi\nHe sende eft. swa swa he \u00e6r behet \u00feone ylcan gast of heofonum: to \u00fei \u00f0\u00e6t we sceolon lufian god\nAn is se halga gast. \u00feeah \u00f0e he tua become ofer \u00feam apostolon;\nSwa is eac an lufu: and twa bebodu \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon lufian god and men;\nAc we sceolon leornian on mannum hu we magon becuman to godes lufe: swa swa iohannes se\nWe wur\u00feia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes tocyme mid lofsangum seofon dagas. for \u00fean \u00f0e he onbryrd ure\nSe \u00f0e \u00feurh godum geearnungum becym\u00f0 to \u00f0isum seofonfealdum gifum \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes: he\nAc se \u00fee wyle to \u00feyssere ge\u00feinc\u00f0e becuman he sceal gelyfan on \u00fe\u00e6re halgan \u00ferynnysse and on\n\u00d0isne geleafan getacnodon \u00fea \u00f0reo \u00f0usend \u00fee \u00e6rest gebugon to geleafan: \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes\nSwa swa \u00fea \u00fereo \u00f0usend w\u00e6ron an werod. swa is seo halige \u00ferynnys an god;\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t werod w\u00e6s swa anmod. swilce him eallum w\u00e6re an heorte and an sawul: for \u00fean \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6re\n\u00d0a geleaffullan brohton heora feoh. and ledon hit \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6ra apostola foton;\nMid \u00feam is geswutelod \u00fe\u00e6t cristene menn ne sceolon heora hiht besettan on woroldlicum\nSe gitsere \u00fee besett his hiht on his goldhorde he bi\u00f0 swa swa se apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0. \u00feam gelic \u00f0e\nHi heoldon \u00fe\u00e6t gold unwur\u00f0lice for \u00fean \u00f0e seo gitsung n\u00e6fde n\u00e6nne stede on heora heortan;\nFor \u00fei hi dydon heora \u00feing him gem\u00e6ne. \u00fe\u00e6t hi on so\u00fere sibbe buton gitsunge beon mihton;\nHi setton heora handa ofer geleaffullum mannum. and him com to se halga gast. \u00feurh heora\nBiscopas synd \u00fe\u00e6s ylcan hades on godes gela\u00f0unge. and healda\u00f0 \u00fea gesetnysse on heora",
